window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Wealthy businessman Gabriel Bishop rules the boardroom with the same determination and ruthlessness that made him a rock star on the rugby field. He knows what he wants, and he'll go after it no holds barred. And what he wants is Charlotte Baird. </p> <p>Charlotte knows she's a mouse. Emotionally scarred and painfully shy, she just wants to do her job and remain as invisible as possible. But the new CEO - a brilliant, broad-shouldered <i>T. rex</i> of a man who growls and storms through the office, leaving carnage in his wake - clearly has other plans. And these plans may be equal parts business and bedroom. </p> <p>If Charlotte intends to survive this battle of wits and hearts, the mouse will have to learn to wrangle the <i>T. rex</i>. Game on. </p>"; 
